                <invention-title lang="de">SENSORSCHALTUNG ZUR STEUERUNG, DETEKTION UND MESSUNG EINES MOLEKULAREN KOMPLEXES</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">CIRCUIT DE CAPTEUR POUR COMMANDER, DÉTECTER ET MESURER UN COMPLEXE MOLÉCULAIRE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">SENSOR CIRCUIT FOR CONTROLLING, DETECTING, AND MEASURING A MOLECULAR COMPLEX</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A device for controlling, detecting, and measuring a molecular complex is disclosed. The device comprises a common electrode. The device further comprises a plurality of measurement cells. Each measurement cell includes a cell electrode and an integrator electronically coupled to the cell electrode. The integrator measures the current flowing between the common electrode and the cell electrode. The device further comprises a plurality of analog-to-digital converters, wherein an integrator from the plurality of measurement cells is electrically coupled to one analog-to-digital converter of the plurality of analog-to-digital converters.</p>
            </abstract>
